# Pairs with RevocationTakesEffect. A peer that acknowledges the push but
# keeps trusting its snapshot serves the revoked grant after the write
# returned.
MODULE: DeliverKeepsTrust
TARGET: RevocationTakesEffect
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the peer acknowledges the epoch push without marking its snapshot out of date
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
    /\ captured' = FALSE
    /\ trusted' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ captured' = FALSE
    /\ trusted' = trusted
--- END